name hypernat
category Package
revision 17358
shortdesc Allow hyperref and natbib to work together
relocated 1
longdesc Allows hyperref package and the natbib package with options
longdesc 'numbers' and 'sort&compress' to work together. This means that
longdesc multiple sequential citations (e.g [3,2,1]) will be compressed
longdesc to [1-3], where the '1' and the '3' are (color-)linked to the
longdesc bibliography.
runfiles size=2
